    - target: {fileID: 2899737726056450040, guid: eb87be1fb1853c14eb7feb36eee9b6f4, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '"I cooked dinner tonight. Creamy curry chicken pasta, just like I always
        make. But when I took a bite... nothing. No taste of the spices, no warmth.
        I ate the whole plate, but I don''t feel full. I just feel numb. Maybe the
        ingredients went bad?"'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
